sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Collaborateur autorisé
    participant MCP as MCP KYA
    participant Data as DataService / Neon
    participant Queue as Outbox à bail
    participant Worker as Connecteur Web KYA
    participant Web as kya-energy.com
    participant Store as Neon Object Storage

    User->>MCP: start_ingestion + confirmation
    MCP->>Data: créer le run idempotent
    Data-->>Queue: kya.data.run.started.v1
    Queue->>Worker: run + contexte gouverné
    Worker->>Web: robots, sitemap, pages bornées
    Web-->>Worker: réponses HTTP
    Worker->>Worker: extraire + paquet canonique + digest
    Worker->>Store: PUT immuable adressé par digest
    Store-->>Worker: version objet
    Worker->>Data: complete_run + qualité + snapshot
    Data-->>Queue: kya.data.run.completed.v1
